---
import { showcaseData } from '../data/content';
---

<section class="work section-pad" id="work" data-dark-section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">{showcaseData.badge}</p>
      <h2>{showcaseData.headline}</h2>
      <p>{showcaseData.description}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="showcase-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="showcase-card__image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1619642751034-765dfdf7c58e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&h=1100&q=86" alt="Mulya Lestari - Sistem Informasi Manajemen Bengkel Mobil" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="showcase-status">● LIVE PRODUCTION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-card__content">
        <span class="showcase-tag">SISTEM INFORMASI BENGKEL MOBIL</span>
        <h3>MULYA LESTARI</h3>
        <p>Aplikasi web manajemen bengkel mobil multi-cabang. Mengelola pencatatan transaksi servis harian, monitoring inventaris suku cadang, dan pelaporan otomatis secara terpusat.</p>
        
        <div class="showcase-tech">
          <span>Next.js</span>
          <span>TailwindCSS</span>
          <span>PostgreSQL</span>
          <span>REST API</span>
          <span>Cloud Server</span>
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-features">
          <div><b>✓</b> Pencatatan Servis &amp; Transaksi Real-Time</div>
          <div><b>✓</b> Monitoring Stok &amp; Multi-Cabang</div>
          <div><b>✓</b> Rekap &amp; Laporan Otomatis</div>
          <div><b>✓</b> Akses Terenkripsi &amp; Aman</div>
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-actions">
          <a class="button button--acid" href="https://mulyalestari.my.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Buka Aplikasi Live</span>
            <i>↗</i>
          </a>
          <a class="button--ghost" href="/work/mulya-lestari/">
            <span>Detail Studi Kasus</span>
            <i>→</i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="showcase-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="showcase-card__image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472851294608-062f824d29cc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&h=1100&q=86" alt="Astro Commerce D2C - Toko Online Mandiri & E-Commerce" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="showcase-status">● PRODUCTION READY</span>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-card__content">
        <span class="showcase-tag">SISTEM E-COMMERCE &amp; TOKO ONLINE MANDIRI</span>
        <h3>ASTRO COMMERCE D2C</h3>
        <p>Platform toko online mandiri berkinerja tinggi (Astro Island Architecture) tanpa potongan komisi marketplace. Dilengkapi kalkulator hemat admin, katalog interaktif dengan filter instan, checkout QRIS &amp; kurir ekspedisi, serta dashboard admin terpusat.</p>
        
        <div class="showcase-tech">
          <span>Astro</span>
          <span>React</span>
          <span>TailwindCSS</span>
          <span>TypeScript</span>
          <span>Nanostores</span>
          <span>Vercel / Cloudflare</span>
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-features">
          <div><b>✓</b> 0% Potongan Komisi Marketplace (Hemat Puluhan Juta)</div>
          <div><b>✓</b> Integrasi Hitung Ongkir &amp; QRIS Otomatis</div>
          <div><b>✓</b> Performa Ekstrem (Astro Island Architecture)</div>
          <div><b>✓</b> Panel Admin &amp; Notifikasi Order 1-Klik WhatsApp</div>
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-actions">
          <a class="button button--acid" href="https://astro-commerce.demo.my.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Buka Aplikasi Live</span>
            <i>↗</i>
          </a>
          <a class="button--ghost" href="/work/astro-commerce/">
            <span>Detail Studi Kasus</span>
            <i>→</i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="showcase-upcoming" data-reveal>
      <div class="upcoming-badge">✦ PROYEK BERIKUTNYA</div>
      <p>Aplikasi web dan sistem informasi lainnya sedang dalam tahap pengembangan dan akan segera ditambahkan ke portofolio ini.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .showcase-card {
    background: #1e1e1a;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .showcase-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--acid);
  }

  .showcase-card__image {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 400px;
    background: #121210;
  }

  .showcase-card__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .showcase-status {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.25rem;
    left: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(23, 23, 20, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    color: var(--acid);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 244, 69, 0.3);
  }

  .showcase-card__content {
    padding: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .showcase-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--acid);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .showcase-card__content h3 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .showcase-card__content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #b0b0a8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .showcase-tech {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .showcase-tech span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #e0e0d8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .showcase-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #d4d4cb;
  }

  .showcase-features b {
    color: var(--acid);
    margin-right: 0.35rem;
  }

  .showcase-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .button--ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }

  .button--ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: #fff;
  }

  .showcase-upcoming {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .upcoming-badge {
    background: rgba(199, 244, 69, 0.15);
    color: var(--acid);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 244, 69, 0.3);
  }

  .showcase-upcoming p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #9c9c94;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .showcase-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .showcase-card__image {
      min-height: 260px;
    }
    .showcase-card__content {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .showcase-card__content h3 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
    .showcase-features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .showcase-upcoming {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
